NX 200t \n NX 300 \n NX 300h \n NX200T \n NX250 \n NX350 \n RC 200t \n RC 300 \n RC 350 \n RC F \n RX 300 \n RX 330 \n RX 350 \n RX 350H \n RX 400h \n RX 450h \n RX 450HL \n RX300 \n RX400H \n RZ 300e \n RZ 450e \n SC 300 \n SC 400 \n SC 430 \n SC400 \n TX \n TX 350 \n TZ \n UX \n UX 300H \n switch years \n 2023 \n 2022 \n 2021 \n 2020 \n 2019 \n 2018 \n 2017 \n 2016 \n Print this page \n November 15: Toyota 8-Speed Transmission Class Action Lawsuits Consolidated news | 4 days ago \n November 14: Toyota Recalls 323,000 Vehicles Over Exploding Airbags recalls | 5 days ago \nLexus TSB #L-SB-0039-20 \n2021 Lexus RC F \n « Back to RC F TSBs \n Complaints 0 \n Crash Tests 1 \n RC F Recalls 1 \n TSBs 75 \n Lemon Law \n TSB Document: \n MC-10183269-9999.pdf \n Affected Component: FUEL SYSTEM, GASOLINE \n Summary \n TSB: This Service Bulletin provides updated non-electric water pump leak inspection and diagnostic tips for some 2008 ? 2021 model year Lexus vehicles.\nClick a tab for more information. \n Date Published \n OCT 16, 2020 \n NHTSA TSB # \n 10183269 \n Find something helpful? Spread the word. \n Share on Facebook \n Retweet this page \n Email this page \nSearch Lexus TSBs \n Example: \"Bad Brakes\", \"Toyota Recall\", etc. \nBecome a Fan & Spread the Word \nAbout CarComplaints.com ® \nCarComplaints.com ® is an online automotive complaint resource that uses graphs to show automotive defect patterns, based on complaint data submitted by visitors to the site. The complaints are organized into groups with data published by vehicle, vehicle component, and specific problem. \nFollow Us Elsewhere \n CarComplaints.com on Facebook \n CarComplaints.com on Twitter \n CarComplaints.com on Google+ \n Got an iPhone? m.carcomplaints.com \nTop Links \n Add a Complaint \n Search Complaints \n Top 20 Worst Vehicles \n Lemon Law Information \n Car Problem Resources \nSign up for our newsletter and stay tuned. \n-->\nAround the Site \n Information \n Find out more about us in the pre